post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'
Littera runs as `littera` (or from your desktop environment's launcher).
The first dictation downloads the speech model (~751 MB) into
~/.local/share/littera/models.

Inserting text needs write access to /dev/uinput; the hotkey device
fallback needs read access to /dev/input/event*. logind's uaccess ACL
usually grants both for the active session. If the settings window
reports otherwise, run `littera --diagnostics` for the full picture.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
    post_install
}
